  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivering Girl-Centred Action: Support to Girls First Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO are supporting Girls First Fund core activities and pilot government-donor grant making in Dominican Republican. ODA contributions will support the organisations diversification of funding to continue to amplify the leadership of locally led initiative and girl-centred programming in efforts to tackle CEFMU.</narrative>
